    {
      "index": 32,
      "tag": "div",
      "attrs": {
        "class": "flex-vertical whitney theme-dark"
      },
      "text": "\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n⬥ The following ARE REQUIRED for this method to work:\n    • Cutting corners will result in failure\n    • A more extensive list can be found in #unknown-channel\n\nItems\n⬥ Igneous Kal-Mor \n⬥ Scripture of Jas \n⬥ Enhanced excalibur \n⬥ Attuned Portent of Restoration X \n⬥ Ring of death \nAbilities\n⬥ Darkness \n⬥ Conjure Undead Army \nOther\n⬥ Thermal Bath and Bonfire HP boost\n    • Wearing HP boosting equipment when you get your bonfire boost will increase the amount of bonus health received from the bonfire\n⬥ Death Ward Relic \n⬥ Hellhound familiar \n\n\n\n\n\n\n",
      "location": {
        "start": 168248,
        "end": 171994
      }
